      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Menjalankan Verifikasi",
      "id": "run-verification",
      "intro": "Verifikasi adalah fitur untuk menguji rule sebelum diaktivasi. Anda bisa mensimulasikan rule dengan data sample untuk memastikan rule berfungsi seperti yang diharapkan.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Jalankan Verifikasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Run Verification** di toolbar editor\n• Pilih data sample (dari data yang ada atau input manual)\n• Klik **Run** — sistem mensimulasikan eksekusi rule\n• Hasil: ✅ ALERT, ❌ No Alert, ⚠️ Error",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"padding:10px 22px;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">▶️ Run Verification</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Membaca Hasil Verifikasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Hijau** — Node terpenuhi (true)\n• **Merah** — Node tidak terpenuhi (false)\n• **Abu-abu** — Node tidak dieksekusi\n• Lihat log detail tiap langkah eksekusi",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#22c55e;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;\">True</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#ef4444;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">False</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;background:#e2e8f0;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Not Executed</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tips Verifikasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• ✅ Uji data positif (harus menghasilkan ALERT)\n• ✅ Uji data negatif (tidak menghasilkan ALERT)\n• ✅ Uji edge case (data di batas threshold)\n• ✅ Uji banyak sample dengan data berbeda",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#fff);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;\">✅ Data positif</span><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">✅ Data negatif</span><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fffbeb;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#d97706;\">✅ Edge cases</span><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#4338ca;\">✅ Multiple data</span></div>"
